space_Veins smoke tests. Please ignore.

To run this simulation, execute the script `sim/space_veins_testsims/space_veins_test/runall`.

This simulation requires sumo-launchd to be started and listening for
connections on a TCP socket, e.g. using "~/lib/veins/src/veins/bin/veins_launchd -vv".


This test checks some edge cases of `SGP4::jday_SGP4`, which calculates Julian dates and the minutes between them (these are calculated in `SGP4Mobility::initialize`).
The tested cases were calculated online and compared with the calculated simulation values.

The test cases are:
- a random date
- 31 December - January 01 (new year, new month and new day)
- 29 February (leap year)


